<mxGraphModel><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;LaminarFlow-Backend/internal/frontend/frontend.go&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="700" y="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#class#handler&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Andale Mono&quot;&gt;handler&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/a&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="700" y="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Andale Mono&quot;&gt;package frontend&lt;/font&gt; — unexported (~) helper on *handler&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;called twice from &lt;a href=&quot;#func#handler.ServeHTTP&quot;&gt;ServeHTTP&lt;/a&gt;: once for the requested path, once for the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;index.html fallback&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="60" width="700" y="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;func (h *handler)&lt;b&gt; serveFile(&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;w http.ResponseWriter&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;r *http.Request&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;name string&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;hashed bool&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font&gt;) bool&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="120" width="700" y="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Returns bool — true when the response has been written: the file was served, or the read&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;failed and a 500 went out. false when name is not in the bundle, or is a directory, which&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;is what lets ServeHTTP fall through to the app shell. No error value; failures go to w&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="60" width="700" y="500" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;-&amp;gt; true after http.ServeContent or an http.Error; false on fs.ErrNotExist, a failed Stat, or a dir&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="700" y="560" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;{&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;f, err := h.files.Open(name)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;if err != nil {&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;if !errors.Is(err, fs.ErrNotExist) {&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;http.Error(w, &quot;read bundle&quot;, http.StatusInternalServerError)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;return true&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;return false&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;defer f.Close()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;info, err := f.Stat()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;if err != nil || info.IsDir() {&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;return false&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;seeker, ok := f.(io.ReadSeeker)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;if !ok {&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;http.Error(w, &quot;bundle file is not seekable&quot;, http.StatusInternalServerError)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;return true&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;hashed says the filename carries a content hash, as everything Vite emits into assets/&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;does — a change produces a new filename, so those can be cached forever&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;if hashed {&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;w.Header().Set(&quot;Cache-Control&quot;, &quot;public, max-age=31536000, immutable&quot;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;} else {&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;index.html cannot: its name never changes and it is what points at the new hashes, so a&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;cached shell keeps loading the old one and asking for asset hashes that no longer exist&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;w.Header().Set(&quot;Cache-Control&quot;, &quot;no-cache&quot;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;ServeContent sets Content-Type from the extension and handles range requests and&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;conditional GETs&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;http.ServeContent(w, r, info.Name(), info.ModTime(), seeker)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;return true&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="740" width="700" y="590" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>
